[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9362.87, "timestamp": "02:36:02", "text": "呃，然后是导向螺栓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9363.75, "timestamp": "02:36:03", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9366.79, "timestamp": "02:36:06", "text": "雷电也是范围攻击技能，我猜。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9369.11, "timestamp": "02:36:09", "text": "是的。是的，枪炮弹是攻击波"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9371.349, "timestamp": "02:36:11", "text": "是范围攻击。我想知道为什么它只显示成这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9373.03, "timestamp": "02:36:13", "text": "前三次罐头之旅。等等，让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9380.79, "timestamp": "02:36:20", "text": "是的，它应该会显示你所有的罐头。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9382.389, "timestamp": "02:36:22", "text": "不知道为什么它只显示成这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9384.55, "timestamp": "02:36:24", "text": "前三个，但是，嗯，我的意思是，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9386.469, "timestamp": "02:36:26", "text": "只有当你点击时才会显示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9389.429, "timestamp": "02:36:29", "text": "canrip，它只显示前几个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9391.349, "timestamp": "02:36:31", "text": "正确的？你其实可以像去你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9392.95, "timestamp": "02:36:32", "text": "角色卡用来做其他角色的，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9396.23, "timestamp": "02:36:36", "text": "是的，为了罐头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9399.59, "timestamp": "02:36:39", "text": "呃，把表格拿过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9401.429, "timestamp": "02:36:41", "text": "是的，如果你也能做这些事的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9403.19, "timestamp": "02:36:43", "text": "就像从上方施放咒语一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9404.07, "timestamp": "02:36:44", "text": "那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9404.63, "timestamp": "02:36:44", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9406.63, "timestamp": "02:36:46", "text": "是的。点击它，就会施法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9407.91, "timestamp": "02:36:47", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9411.67, "timestamp": "02:36:51", "text": "哦，我可以。哦，施个魔法吧。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9415.59, "timestamp": "02:36:55", "text": "好的。呃，Shalle 就像在说“等等”。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9419.11, "timestamp": "02:36:59", "text": "有点复杂。你不不不吗？"}]